The [[Claws of Attack]] are a [[weapon]] obtained by combining the [[Gloves of Haste]] with a [[Walrus Tusk]]. It is a consistent source of {{icon/empower}}, although it only generates one every four hits, meaning only one {{icon/empower}} every 6.4s by default. It is also sped up slightly for each {{icon/spikes}} the player has, which also speeds up this {{icon/empower}} gain.
